WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.930
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.200 --> 01:43.920
Look here, everyone.

3
01:44.599 --> 01:47.239
A prominent leader in our nation's chemical research,

4
01:47.359 --> 01:49.280
from Nanhai University's Institute of Chemical Engineering,

5
01:49.319 --> 01:50.480
Professor Du Guangming,

6
01:50.640 --> 01:51.560
two weeks ago,

7
01:51.760 --> 01:53.040
was invited to Country M

8
01:53.040 --> 01:54.239
to attend an academic conference.

9
01:55.200 --> 01:57.120
He suddenly lost contact during the event.

10
01:57.400 --> 01:58.719
Subsequent investigations revealed that

11
01:59.120 --> 02:02.159
Professor Du Guangming was abducted and taken away.

12
02:02.840 --> 02:04.040
Interpol

13
02:04.560 --> 02:05.760
has placed its suspicions

14
02:05.920 --> 02:07.400
squarely on the Piyazi Gang.

15
02:07.480 --> 02:10.039
Currently, the Chinese Embassy in Country M

16
02:10.479 --> 02:12.039
is urging Country M's police

17
02:12.120 --> 02:13.520
to solve this case as soon as possible.

18
02:13.599 --> 02:16.240
We attach great importance to this case,

19
02:16.240 --> 02:17.159
and have decided to dispatch

20
02:17.319 --> 02:18.840
an experienced, elite officer

21
02:19.000 --> 02:20.919
to assist Country M's police with the investigation.

22
02:21.199 --> 02:22.360
Prior investigations indicate that

23
02:22.719 --> 02:25.840
Li Qiang will meet Ma Jingrong in Country M.

24
02:25.960 --> 02:27.560
Colleague Li Xiao is now instructed,

25
02:28.159 --> 02:29.080
while in Country M

26
02:29.319 --> 02:31.319
investigating Ms. Tian Xin's whereabouts,

27
02:31.919 --> 02:34.680
to simultaneously undertake the rescue

28
02:34.680 --> 02:36.080
of Professor Du Guangming on this mission.

29
02:41.520 --> 02:44.120
Our investigation will soon close in on

30
02:44.120 --> 02:46.639
the Xiang syndicate, the major drug lords of Jiechan State.

31
02:47.439 --> 02:49.039
I believe that with our efforts,

32
02:49.120 --> 02:50.560
alongside Country M's police

33
02:50.879 --> 02:53.400
and the strong backing of Interpol,

34
02:54.360 --> 02:56.680
we will surely eradicate the Piyazi Gang

35
02:56.960 --> 02:58.080
and the Theerade syndicate,

36
02:58.360 --> 02:59.840
rooting out these two malignant tumors.

37
03:01.120 --> 03:01.840
At present,

38
03:02.120 --> 03:04.080
Operation Thunderbolt's main battleground

39
03:04.400 --> 03:07.319
has shifted from Nanhai to the border and Country M.

40
03:08.039 --> 03:09.439
The officers of our anti-narcotics unit

41
03:10.199 --> 03:12.400
must, throughout this major operation,

42
03:12.560 --> 03:13.400
redouble their efforts,

43
03:13.599 --> 03:15.280
unite with all forces of justice,

44
03:15.599 --> 03:17.599
and completely dismantle the criminal syndicates

45
03:17.599 --> 03:19.560
that threaten our country and people.

46
03:33.560 --> 03:35.520
Recommending you to investigate this case in Country M

47
03:36.240 --> 03:37.199
was my decision.

48
03:40.800 --> 03:42.840
Back then, I couldn't bring my comrade back.

49
03:43.919 --> 03:46.439
This time, I hope you can bring his daughter

50
03:46.800 --> 03:48.000
back safely.

51
03:51.759 --> 03:52.319
Yes, sir.

52
04:55.360 --> 04:55.959
Not bad.

53
04:55.959 --> 04:57.000
That one's not bad either.

54
05:16.240 --> 05:18.040
When Mr. Ma approached me before,

55
05:18.600 --> 05:20.040
I did have some concerns.

56
05:20.360 --> 05:23.199
So I told him to meet Mr. Jiang first.

57
05:24.120 --> 05:25.879
Who knew that on your first shipment,

58
05:25.920 --> 05:26.879
not only did you botch it,

59
05:27.600 --> 05:29.120
you even alerted the police.

60
05:35.439 --> 05:37.519
It was my fault for mishandling it last time.

61
05:37.680 --> 05:39.120
I didn't expect the rented factory

62
05:39.240 --> 05:41.680
to be tied to Country M's stolen treasure.

63
05:42.160 --> 05:44.600
Now that Mr. Ma is finally out,

64
05:45.120 --> 05:45.800
even though the police

65
05:45.800 --> 05:47.399
are still following the stolen treasure

66
05:47.560 --> 05:48.360
leads to keep investigating,

67
05:49.319 --> 05:50.319
I believe

68
05:51.480 --> 05:52.639
our future operations

69
05:54.079 --> 05:55.560
won't be affected.

70
05:56.680 --> 05:58.040
How could they not be affected?

71
05:59.800 --> 06:01.560
Doesn't Xiao Zhuang have charges hanging over him too?

72
06:04.319 --> 06:06.120
Better safe than sorry.

73
06:06.360 --> 06:07.160
Over the years,

74
06:07.399 --> 06:10.040
I've put men in the government and police.

75
06:11.079 --> 06:12.079
As for your case,

76
06:12.240 --> 06:14.040
I'll find a way to have it buried.

77
06:14.279 --> 06:15.279
But remember this:

78
06:15.839 --> 06:17.920
do not provoke the police again,

79
06:18.120 --> 06:20.560
and above all, never cross The Four Great Families.

80
06:21.040 --> 06:22.199
Don't worry, sir.

81
06:22.680 --> 06:24.240
We've just arrived in Country M,

82
06:24.439 --> 06:25.399
as newcomers,

83
06:25.560 --> 06:28.000
we shouldn't cross paths with local gangs anyway.

84
06:29.079 --> 06:30.439
You're working for me now.

85
06:30.800 --> 06:33.680
The Four Great Families will find out.

86
06:34.120 --> 06:34.680
So,

87
06:35.199 --> 06:37.079
even if they pick a fight with you,

88
06:37.360 --> 06:39.040
you must hold back.

89
06:39.959 --> 06:43.120
With Mr. Theerade's power in Country M,

90
06:43.160 --> 06:46.680
are we really afraid of those four old geezers?

91
06:57.800 --> 06:59.160
It's not fear.

92
06:59.639 --> 07:00.759
It's respect.

93
07:01.759 --> 07:03.319
It's this respect

94
07:03.639 --> 07:04.839
that got me where I am today.

95
07:11.680 --> 07:12.560
So,

96
07:12.800 --> 07:15.079
how do you plan to expand the Greater China market?

97
07:16.839 --> 07:19.759
Previously, in Central and South China,

98
07:19.879 --> 07:21.240
as well as the Northeast,

99
07:21.480 --> 07:22.920
we brought in a lot of clients.

100
07:23.360 --> 07:24.399
However, right now,

101
07:24.519 --> 07:25.439
our business

102
07:25.759 --> 07:27.720
can only operate in South China

103
07:28.319 --> 07:30.759
because some transit stations ran into trouble.

104
07:31.240 --> 07:32.360
Don't worry, though.

105
07:32.399 --> 07:33.600
Give me three months,

106
07:33.839 --> 07:36.040
and I'll definitely get these transit stations

107
07:36.240 --> 07:37.920
running smoothly again.

108
07:38.319 --> 07:40.160
No, no, no.

109
07:41.639 --> 07:43.319
I don't have three months to wait for you.

110
07:46.120 --> 07:48.199
Sir, what Brother Ma means is,

111
07:48.199 --> 07:50.240
three months is just a conservative estimate.

112
07:50.720 --> 07:53.160
With Brother Ma's connections in China,

113
07:53.319 --> 07:54.759
bringing in major clients

114
07:55.040 --> 07:56.040
won't be a problem at all.

115
07:56.040 --> 07:56.879
It's very simple.

116
07:57.680 --> 07:59.319
I also have some potential clients lined up.

117
07:59.759 --> 08:01.319
If you trust us, sir,

118
08:01.839 --> 08:03.879
we'll break into the market as soon as possible.

119
08:04.800 --> 08:07.519
In a few days, Xiao Zhuang and I will head to Jiangyang.

120
08:07.759 --> 08:08.279
Mr. Theerade,

121
08:08.319 --> 08:10.120
you don't have to worry about the shipments.

122
08:12.560 --> 08:14.319
Prepare some samples for Mr. Ma.

123
08:15.759 --> 08:18.120
The drug market is a seller's market.

124
08:19.120 --> 08:20.360
We never lack buyers.

125
08:21.399 --> 08:23.160
But what about customs?

126
08:24.120 --> 08:25.079
How do we solve that?

127
08:26.519 --> 08:27.000
Sir,

128
08:27.319 --> 08:29.480
Xiao Zhuang has connections in mainland China too.

129
08:29.639 --> 08:31.480
I'll take care of customs clearance.

130
08:32.240 --> 08:33.120
Though...

131
08:33.600 --> 08:34.879
Money is not an issue.

132
08:35.039 --> 08:36.639
Discuss it with Mr. Jiang.

133
08:37.240 --> 08:40.879
Securing the Greater China market is what matters most.

134
08:40.879 --> 08:42.159
Rest assured, Mr. Theerade.

135
08:42.320 --> 08:43.639
Since you put it that way,

136
08:43.919 --> 08:45.960
I'll definitely do everything I can.

137
08:46.559 --> 08:47.159
Good.

138
08:47.720 --> 08:48.559
Then it's settled.

139
08:49.960 --> 08:52.559
Sir, I'll go get the goods ready.

140
08:52.720 --> 08:53.159
Okay.

141
08:56.679 --> 08:57.639
Mr. Theerade,

142
08:57.799 --> 08:58.840
the elders of The Four Great Families

143
08:58.879 --> 09:00.279
heard your hotel is opening today

144
09:00.360 --> 09:01.320
and sent over gifts.

145
09:01.320 --> 09:03.039
They're asking you to come greet them.

146
09:08.960 --> 09:10.799
Alright, let's go.

147
09:12.919 --> 09:13.480
This way.

148
09:24.080 --> 09:25.519
Congratulations.

149
09:25.519 --> 09:26.200
Welcome.

150
09:27.159 --> 09:27.720
Please.

151
09:46.039 --> 09:47.240
Theerade wants us

152
09:47.240 --> 09:48.879
to deliver on such short notice.

153
09:50.039 --> 09:50.559
Old Ma,

154
09:51.200 --> 09:53.799
could there be any issues on your end?

155
09:59.600 --> 10:01.360
Since Mr. Theerade put it that way,

156
10:01.840 --> 10:03.159
let's just get the job done right.

157
10:03.559 --> 10:04.679
Besides, I think

158
10:05.000 --> 10:06.480
Mr. Theerade has a point.

159
10:06.840 --> 10:08.240
As long as our stuff is good enough,

160
10:09.039 --> 10:10.360
we won't have trouble finding buyers.

161
10:12.200 --> 10:14.720
There shouldn't be any problem with buyers.

162
10:15.120 --> 10:16.720
You don't need to worry about that.

163
10:18.000 --> 10:20.919
In a few days, Xiao Zhuang will return to Jiangyang with me.

164
10:25.720 --> 10:26.399
Old Qin.

165
10:27.519 --> 10:30.480
There's a favor I need to ask of you.

166
10:31.120 --> 10:33.240
Old Ma, we're brothers.

167
10:33.480 --> 10:35.000
We're in the same boat now.

168
10:35.200 --> 10:36.279
Why be so polite?

169
10:36.399 --> 10:37.440
Just speak your mind.

170
10:38.440 --> 10:39.840
After I went to prison,

171
10:40.679 --> 10:42.399
I lost touch with a brother of mine

172
10:42.399 --> 10:43.639
named Li Qiang.

173
10:45.080 --> 10:46.200
But I believe

174
10:46.320 --> 10:47.639
as long as he's still alive,

175
10:48.080 --> 10:50.200
he'll definitely come back here to find me.

176
10:51.000 --> 10:52.120
If I'm not around,

177
10:53.000 --> 10:54.080
I'll leave him in your hands.

178
11:00.039 --> 11:00.799
Don't worry.

179
11:01.039 --> 11:03.440
I'll definitely take care of it for you.

180
11:13.399 --> 11:14.879
I'll remember you.

181
11:15.679 --> 11:16.480
Thank you.

182
11:17.559 --> 11:19.120
Though I'll forget you very soon.

183
11:20.000 --> 11:20.559
Take him away.

184
11:35.720 --> 11:37.320
The elders are tied up with business today,

185
11:37.360 --> 11:40.039
so they couldn't congratulate Mr. Theerade

186
11:40.039 --> 11:41.320
in person. Please excuse their absence.

187
11:43.639 --> 11:46.960
Please tell the elders when you return

188
11:47.279 --> 11:50.200
that Theerade is deeply touched by their kind thoughts.

189
11:51.399 --> 11:54.399
Mr. Theerade's theme park just opened,

190
11:54.399 --> 11:56.840
and now a new hotel has already been built.

191
11:57.480 --> 11:59.559
Your business is truly flourishing.

192
11:59.919 --> 12:01.159
However, this hotel, Mr. Theerade,

193
12:01.159 --> 12:03.039
seems to have crossed the line.

194
12:03.480 --> 12:06.759
The elders would like to hear your explanation.

195
12:09.159 --> 12:10.879
Before our hotel was built,

196
12:11.039 --> 12:14.279
we notified The Four Great Families.

197
12:14.840 --> 12:17.879
Today is Mr. Theerade's hotel opening.

198
12:18.000 --> 12:19.720
Are you looking for trouble?

199
12:28.840 --> 12:30.879
We're only here to deliver the elders' message.

200
12:31.120 --> 12:32.080
Mr. Theerade,

201
12:32.080 --> 12:33.919
if you have any issue with the elders,

202
12:34.200 --> 12:36.480
you can tell them in person.

203
12:36.799 --> 12:38.320
It seems Mr. Theerade

204
12:38.320 --> 12:40.279
doesn't wish to address this for now.

205
12:40.919 --> 12:43.120
Regardless, our message has been delivered.

206
12:43.120 --> 12:44.399
Farewell.

207
12:44.799 --> 12:45.759
How dare you!

208
12:46.320 --> 12:47.480
Is Mr. Theerade's place

209
12:47.639 --> 12:49.519
a place to come and go as you please?

210
12:51.840 --> 12:52.919
Mr. Theerade,

211
12:53.240 --> 12:55.320
are you defying The Four Great Families?

212
12:58.120 --> 12:59.039
Relax.

213
13:08.759 --> 13:10.159
Haven't I told you before?

214
13:10.240 --> 13:11.519
Toward The Four Great Families,

215
13:12.080 --> 13:13.200
you must not be so disrespectful.

216
13:24.639 --> 13:26.559
My men were out of line.

217
13:26.600 --> 13:28.159
Please don't take offense.

218
13:28.559 --> 13:31.440
Since the elders sent you with a message,

219
13:31.639 --> 13:34.080
I can't let you leave empty-handed.

220
13:47.960 --> 13:49.480
Here are four documents.

221
13:50.240 --> 13:55.320
They're shares for my New Tailai Hotel.

222
13:56.120 --> 13:59.519
Annually, each of The Four Great Families

223
13:59.519 --> 14:00.720
can receive from my hotel

224
14:00.720 --> 14:03.080
a ten percent share of the profits.

225
14:05.919 --> 14:09.320
In fact, the Elders don't need to tell me what to do.

226
14:09.799 --> 14:10.799
I already know what needs to be done.

227
14:11.720 --> 14:15.679
You won't need to draw knives or guns here from now on.

228
14:23.000 --> 14:25.399
I hope Mr. Theerade won't take offense.

229
14:25.519 --> 14:26.559
I won't see you out, then.

230
14:53.840 --> 14:54.639
Have you really decided

231
14:54.840 --> 14:55.919
to go to Jiangyang with Ma Jingrong?

232
14:56.519 --> 14:57.000
Yeah.

233
14:57.720 --> 14:59.159
If I don't handle things properly for Theerade,

234
14:59.279 --> 15:00.919
why would he trust me, right?

235
15:02.240 --> 15:02.879
No way.

236
15:03.320 --> 15:04.600
I think it's too dangerous for the two of you.

237
15:05.159 --> 15:06.080
Let me come with you.

238
15:06.320 --> 15:07.639
You know it's dangerous, yet you still want to tag along?

239
15:08.000 --> 15:09.200
Just stay right here

240
15:09.480 --> 15:10.519
and stop messing things up.

241
15:11.120 --> 15:12.240
Messing things up?

242
15:12.799 --> 15:13.639
If it weren't for me,

243
15:20.720 --> 15:21.200
if it weren't for me

244
15:21.200 --> 15:22.879
pulling you out of prison back then,

245
15:23.039 --> 15:24.600
you'd probably be dead in there by now.

246
15:26.080 --> 15:27.320
I'm just going there to talk business.

247
15:27.320 --> 15:28.440
What would you even do there?

248
15:28.759 --> 15:30.480
Having you around will only get in the way.

249
15:31.039 --> 15:32.200
All right, it's settled.

250
15:32.240 --> 15:32.960
Drop it.

251
15:33.559 --> 15:34.080
Can you please

252
15:34.080 --> 15:35.399
drop your macho attitude?

253
15:35.480 --> 15:36.320
I'm just worried about you,

254
15:36.399 --> 15:37.240
which is why I want to go with you.

255
15:37.279 --> 15:38.759
Why do you never understand?

256
15:38.759 --> 15:39.159
Wait,

257
15:44.600 --> 15:45.759
are you mad already?

258
16:19.559 --> 16:20.399
Don't be mad.

259
16:28.320 --> 16:29.320
Were you serious just now?

260
16:29.399 --> 16:30.600
You aren't actually mad, are you?

261
16:31.879 --> 16:32.759
Are you really mad?

262
16:37.320 --> 16:38.480
Life is a play,

263
16:38.759 --> 16:39.720
it's all about acting.

264
16:43.279 --> 16:44.399
Where to, you two?

265
16:45.360 --> 16:46.000
Hold on.

266
16:46.320 --> 16:47.320
Are you getting into character too?

267
16:47.360 --> 16:48.200
Just drive.

268
16:51.240 --> 16:52.960
Any news from Jiang Liye?

269
16:54.600 --> 16:56.519
He's indeed very cautious.

270
16:56.679 --> 16:57.879
Lately, wherever I go,

271
16:58.080 --> 16:59.080
he has someone tailing me.

272
17:01.480 --> 17:02.879
He doesn't completely trust me yet.

273
17:03.080 --> 17:04.960
We must be extra careful when we contact each other.

274
17:06.359 --> 17:08.119
I found that Jiang Liye has already sent men

275
17:08.160 --> 17:09.920
to tail Ma Jingrong and Li Siqi.

276
17:10.680 --> 17:13.119
I don't think he suspects the two of you yet.

277
17:14.279 --> 17:15.480
Still, from now on,

278
17:15.880 --> 17:16.880
we need to be even more cautious.

279
17:18.079 --> 17:18.720
Understood.

280
17:21.599 --> 17:23.119
What we're dealing with now

281
17:23.839 --> 17:25.880
are the kingpins of Country M's drug ring.

282
17:29.599 --> 17:31.319
The ones Theerade fears the most right now

283
17:31.319 --> 17:33.119
are The Four Great Families and Piyazi.

284
17:33.720 --> 17:34.480
If we can exploit

285
17:34.480 --> 17:35.680
the conflicts between them,

286
17:36.160 --> 17:37.519
could we take them all down at once?

287
17:39.480 --> 17:40.559
You're right.

288
17:41.000 --> 17:42.759
We can use their internal conflicts

289
17:43.160 --> 17:44.160
to wipe them all out together.

290
17:44.279 --> 17:45.279
But I've noticed

291
17:45.480 --> 17:47.160
Theerade got into the drug trade

292
17:47.400 --> 17:48.440
because one day he wants

293
17:48.640 --> 17:50.440
to rival The Four Great Families.

294
17:51.640 --> 17:52.680
In any case,

295
17:52.880 --> 17:53.799
our current objective

296
17:53.839 --> 17:55.640
is to keep a close eye on Theerade and Piyazi.

297
17:56.279 --> 17:58.160
Theerade wants to enter Southeast Asia,

298
17:58.279 --> 18:00.319
likely to expand his power quickly.

299
18:01.359 --> 18:01.839
That's right.

300
18:02.559 --> 18:03.319
Don't worry.

301
18:03.839 --> 18:04.839
I will personally coordinate

302
18:04.880 --> 18:06.720
the communication between Jiangyang and Nanhai police.

303
18:07.440 --> 18:08.000
All right.

304
18:15.559 --> 18:16.599
Any word on Li Qiang?

305
18:17.039 --> 18:18.160
We received a tip

306
18:18.440 --> 18:19.839
that people were smuggled into Country M.

307
18:20.319 --> 18:22.000
Two of them have descriptions

308
18:22.000 --> 18:23.640
very close to Li Qiang and Tian Xin.

309
18:24.359 --> 18:25.319
Rest assured, though.

310
18:25.519 --> 18:27.559
I've already planted someone near Qin Mu.

311
18:28.680 --> 18:30.119
Once there's news of Li Qiang,

312
18:30.200 --> 18:32.119
the Country M police will arrest him immediately.

313
19:31.599 --> 19:33.440
Attention on board!

314
19:34.079 --> 19:35.519
We are Country M police!

315
19:35.720 --> 19:39.039
We suspect you are illegal stowaways from China!

316
19:39.680 --> 19:41.519
Attention on board!

317
19:42.119 --> 19:43.559
We are Country M police!

318
19:44.319 --> 19:45.200
Can you swim?

319
19:48.200 --> 19:48.960
Hold on to me.

320
19:51.440 --> 19:52.440
Go! Over there!

321
20:32.440 --> 20:33.200
What's wrong?

322
20:34.559 --> 20:35.960
I really can't walk anymore.

323
20:39.279 --> 20:42.359
If you don't move, you won't survive.

324
20:46.240 --> 20:47.559
Then just let me die.

325
20:51.559 --> 20:53.319
I don't want to go with you anyway.

326
21:05.000 --> 21:06.640
I know it's all my fault,

327
21:07.759 --> 21:09.160
putting you through all this pain.

328
21:09.680 --> 21:10.519
Don't worry.

329
21:11.920 --> 21:13.480
I'll make it up to you.

330
21:16.759 --> 21:17.519
Make it up to me?

331
21:19.160 --> 21:20.160
How could you?

332
21:20.920 --> 21:22.480
Rather than be with you,

333
21:24.359 --> 21:26.079
I'd rather just die.

334
21:30.400 --> 21:32.000
You think being with him

335
21:32.559 --> 21:34.079
will keep you alive?

336
21:36.359 --> 21:37.240
Cut the crap!

337
21:38.599 --> 21:39.519
Get on your feet!

338
21:41.039 --> 21:42.079
Get up!

339
22:18.680 --> 22:19.279
Mr. Jiang.

340
22:19.319 --> 22:20.319
Is the shipment all ready?

341
22:20.480 --> 22:21.039
All set.

342
22:36.599 --> 22:38.920
These samples are our best stuff.

343
23:00.240 --> 23:01.759
Wishing you victory right from the start.

344
23:50.519 --> 23:52.000
After running around for so many days,

345
23:52.839 --> 23:54.480
a good piss washes all the worries away.

346
24:16.279 --> 24:16.920
Brother Four,

347
24:17.559 --> 24:18.880
when are we heading to Country M?

348
24:22.160 --> 24:24.039
Once we reach Boss Xiang,

349
24:24.119 --> 24:25.480
we'll know when we're going.

350
24:30.079 --> 24:31.880
These shoes are pretty comfortable.

351
24:35.680 --> 24:37.279
Major international brand, huh?

352
24:37.640 --> 24:38.559
They're knockoffs.

353
24:44.440 --> 24:46.000
I'll ask you one last time.

354
24:46.759 --> 24:48.079
Where did the stuff come from?

355
24:48.759 --> 24:51.400
If I talk, will I get two years knocked off?

356
24:52.079 --> 24:53.440
As long as you come clean,

357
24:53.680 --> 24:54.680
I won't pursue this.

358
24:55.400 --> 24:56.240
This stuff...

359
24:57.000 --> 24:59.599
Xiao Shen from Rolling Stone Nightclub sold it to me.

360
24:59.839 --> 25:00.759
Give me his full name.

361
25:01.400 --> 25:02.480
His name is Shen Qing.

362
25:02.519 --> 25:03.960
His boss is Yang Xing.

363
25:04.279 --> 25:06.279
I heard a lot of people have been buying from him lately.

364
25:06.680 --> 25:08.039
It's all Psychedelic Blues.

365
25:09.000 --> 25:12.079
Yang Xing from Rolling Stone Nightclub, right?

366
25:20.839 --> 25:21.599
Lao Si.

367
25:26.039 --> 25:26.920
Got it, Brother Nan.

368
25:27.079 --> 25:27.480
Understood.

369
25:28.079 --> 25:29.359
See you later, then.

370
25:32.079 --> 25:33.880
Are we going to see Brother Nan, Brother Four?

371
25:35.880 --> 25:36.440
Yeah.

372
25:37.359 --> 25:38.480
I set up a meeting with him.

373
25:38.519 --> 25:40.759
Ten tonight at Rolling Stone Nightclub.

374
26:02.400 --> 26:03.720
The target of tonight's arrest operation

375
26:03.759 --> 26:05.720
is Yang Xing, owner of Rolling Stone Club.

376
26:05.920 --> 26:07.160
According to our investigation,

377
26:07.359 --> 26:09.000
many drug dealers in Jiangyang

378
26:09.039 --> 26:10.759
bought their supply from Yang Xing,

379
26:10.799 --> 26:12.400
the new drug, Psychedelic Blues.

380
26:12.839 --> 26:14.079
We believe that capturing Yang Xing

381
26:14.200 --> 26:15.599
will lead us to Cheng Weimin's location.

382
26:16.359 --> 26:16.880
However,

383
26:17.759 --> 26:19.319
Piyazi is also looking for him.

384
26:19.599 --> 26:21.119
We must beat them to it.

385
26:23.559 --> 26:24.559
If we find Cheng Weimin,

386
26:24.920 --> 26:25.839
we'll have the chance

387
26:25.920 --> 26:28.039
to lure out the Poison Wolf, Xiang Nan.

388
26:29.599 --> 26:31.200
Tonight's operation will be split into two teams.

389
26:31.400 --> 26:32.079
I'll take a few officers

390
26:32.119 --> 26:33.599
to stake out inside Rolling Stone Nightclub.

391
26:33.799 --> 26:35.319
The rest will wait outside for my signal.

392
26:35.720 --> 26:36.720
According to our intelligence,

393
26:36.920 --> 26:38.359
Yang Xing will be dealing tonight.

394
26:39.119 --> 26:41.839
So we must catch him red-handed.

395
26:44.200 --> 26:44.759
Let's move out!

396
27:53.039 --> 27:53.559
Keep up.

397
27:59.359 --> 28:00.200
All units, be advised.

398
28:00.400 --> 28:01.759
The suspect has entered the nightclub.

399
28:01.839 --> 28:02.920
Stand by to make the arrest.

400
28:18.839 --> 28:19.400
Brother Four

401
28:37.519 --> 28:39.640
Why are there cops outside the nightclub?

402
28:39.960 --> 28:41.839
Are they here for Brother Nan?

403
28:46.759 --> 28:47.240
Brother Four.

404
28:48.200 --> 28:49.319
Don't tip them off yet.

405
28:49.720 --> 28:50.559
I'll go down and take a look.

406
28:51.799 --> 28:52.559
Be careful.

407
29:12.759 --> 29:14.319
They should be in the innermost private room.

408
29:14.359 --> 29:15.279
There are guards at the door.

409
29:17.240 --> 29:19.359
Move in as soon as the deal goes down.

410
29:19.440 --> 29:20.119
They won't get away.

411
29:20.440 --> 29:21.079
Got it.

412
29:25.319 --> 29:25.880
Wait.

413
29:32.720 --> 29:33.640
Municipal Police.

414
29:34.000 --> 29:35.000
Where's your boss?

415
29:35.079 --> 29:35.519
I don't know.

416
29:35.640 --> 29:36.599
I just work here.

417
29:36.640 --> 29:37.519
Our manager is over there.

418
29:42.400 --> 29:43.839
Where's your boss?

419
29:44.000 --> 29:44.960
The boss isn't here.

420
29:45.039 --> 29:46.200
You can talk to me.

421
29:47.559 --> 29:48.319
Talk to you?

422
29:48.960 --> 29:51.000
Think you can handle a matter of life and death?

423
29:51.440 --> 29:51.960
Move.

424
30:02.319 --> 30:03.119
Attention, all units.

425
30:03.720 --> 30:05.640
Suspect Xiang Nan has entered the nightclub.

426
30:06.079 --> 30:07.240
The club is too crowded.

427
30:07.680 --> 30:09.640
Xiang Nan and his men are likely armed.

428
30:09.799 --> 30:11.480
Making the arrest here is too risky,

429
30:11.680 --> 30:13.160
and civilians could get hurt.

430
30:13.400 --> 30:14.720
We're changing the plan.

431
30:14.960 --> 30:16.359
Once they leave the nightclub,

432
30:16.599 --> 30:17.519
move in for the arrest immediately.

433
31:14.480 --> 31:15.920
Xiang Nan told me and Four-Legged Snake

434
31:15.960 --> 31:17.240
to meet him at Rolling Stone Nightclub.

435
31:17.480 --> 31:18.400
But the Jiangyang police

436
31:18.440 --> 31:20.160
are already staking out the entrance.

437
31:20.319 --> 31:21.680
If they arrest Xiang Nan,

438
31:22.039 --> 31:23.599
Operation Thunderbolt must be aborted.

439
31:23.799 --> 31:24.799
We have a plan now

440
31:24.960 --> 31:26.319
that requires Jiangyang police's help,

441
31:26.480 --> 31:27.359
to let me approach Xiang Nan

442
31:27.400 --> 31:28.440
and win his trust.

443
31:28.559 --> 31:29.240
I'll contact them.

444
31:29.599 --> 31:30.559
Stay safe out there.

445
31:38.680 --> 31:40.160
Chief Zhou, this is Bai Hua.

446
31:46.880 --> 31:47.400
Understood.

447
31:51.319 --> 31:52.319
Don't worry, Chief Zhou.

448
31:52.880 --> 31:53.759
I'll handle the arrangements.

449
32:02.559 --> 32:03.440
All units, attention.

450
32:04.079 --> 32:05.359
Change of plans for the arrest operation.

451
32:10.759 --> 32:11.799
Five hundred grams each.

452
32:12.480 --> 32:13.960
The recipients and addresses

453
32:14.079 --> 32:15.599
have been sent to your phones.

454
32:16.599 --> 32:17.039
Remember,

455
32:19.039 --> 32:20.240
be extremely careful.

456
32:20.960 --> 32:22.400
If you spot anyone tailing you,

457
32:22.759 --> 32:23.720
call off the deal immediately.

458
32:24.119 --> 32:24.880
Don't worry, bro.

459
32:24.960 --> 32:26.319
The boys have never slipped up.

460
32:27.119 --> 32:28.000
Alright, then...

461
32:33.359 --> 32:33.920
What are you doing?

462
32:33.920 --> 32:34.920
They're cops!

463
32:35.119 --> 32:35.799
Back off!

464
32:36.000 --> 32:37.000
Don't move! Don't move!

465
32:37.039 --> 32:37.839
Step back!

466
32:39.720 --> 32:40.559
You're not cops.

467
32:41.400 --> 32:43.559
If I were a cop, you'd be lucky!

468
32:50.400 --> 32:51.200
Not bad.

469
32:52.559 --> 32:53.559
Top grade stuff.

470
32:57.599 --> 32:59.200
Do you know whose stash this is?

471
33:02.880 --> 33:03.400
Sit.

472
33:04.319 --> 33:04.960
Sit down and talk.

473
33:09.480 --> 33:10.880
This is my stash.

474
33:11.960 --> 33:13.519
How did it end up in your hands?

475
33:14.680 --> 33:15.599
I really don't know!

476
33:16.240 --> 33:16.960
I have no idea!

477
33:17.119 --> 33:18.599
I bought it from my supplier!

478
33:19.400 --> 33:20.960
Cheng Weimin, right?

479
33:26.480 --> 33:28.160
Cheng Weimin is my distributor.

480
33:28.160 --> 33:29.839
He ran off with my goods.

481
33:31.440 --> 33:33.200
Xiaotian, take all the stash.

482
33:33.319 --> 33:33.839
Got it.

483
33:36.039 --> 33:38.119
I know you got the stuff from Cheng Weimin.

484
33:38.319 --> 33:39.160
Where is he?

485
33:41.799 --> 33:42.720
Even if I wanted to tell you,

486
33:42.799 --> 33:44.160
I truly don't know where he is.

487
33:45.039 --> 33:45.839
I'm telling the truth!

488
33:45.920 --> 33:46.920
I really don't know!

489
33:57.799 --> 33:58.480
I really don't know.

490
33:59.279 --> 34:00.279
I honestly don't!

491
34:00.559 --> 34:01.880
He always contacts me first.

492
34:02.240 --> 34:03.240
I can't reach him at all.

493
34:04.200 --> 34:05.799
He changes his number all the time.

494
34:06.759 --> 34:09.000
If I can find you, I can find him.

495
34:11.920 --> 34:12.679
I'll talk.

496
34:12.800 --> 34:13.280
I'll talk!

497
34:13.760 --> 34:14.239
I'll talk!

498
34:27.559 --> 34:29.679
He owes me some money for the goods.

499
34:30.360 --> 34:30.840
When the time comes...

500
34:30.960 --> 34:32.639
He'll call me in a couple of days.

501
34:32.920 --> 34:33.159
When he does,

502
34:33.239 --> 34:34.760
I'll give you the exact time and place.

503
34:34.760 --> 34:35.360
Sound good, Boss?

504
34:36.119 --> 34:37.039
Too much trouble.

505
34:37.480 --> 34:39.320
Just come with me.

506
34:42.480 --> 34:43.039
Move.

507
34:43.360 --> 34:43.880
Move!

508
34:45.199 --> 34:45.679
Boss!

509
34:46.159 --> 34:46.639
Ah Qing!

510
35:02.440 --> 35:03.079
Hey, are you there?

511
35:03.199 --> 35:03.519
I'm here.

512
35:03.800 --> 35:04.280
Brother Nan.

513
35:04.519 --> 35:05.679
Keep quiet. Listen to me.

514
35:05.960 --> 35:08.239
There are cops all over the club entrance.

515
35:08.599 --> 35:10.559
Have A-Hao's group use the front door.

516
35:10.880 --> 35:12.480
Bring Yang Xing out through the back door.

517
35:12.880 --> 35:14.159
I'll meet you at the back door.

518
35:14.920 --> 35:15.760
Okay, got it.

519
35:25.199 --> 35:25.960
What's wrong, Brother Nan?

520
35:27.159 --> 35:27.840
Nothing.

521
35:28.480 --> 35:29.440
Wait for me downstairs.

522
35:30.280 --> 35:31.639
I'm taking him to grab something.

523
35:32.480 --> 35:33.400
Behave yourself.

524
35:33.679 --> 35:35.199
Boss, where are we going?

525
35:35.599 --> 35:36.880
Try to run, and I'll kill you.

526
35:44.840 --> 35:45.679
All units, be advised.

527
35:45.840 --> 35:46.760
They're coming out now.

528
35:46.960 --> 35:48.039
Get ready to move in for the arrest.

529
35:55.400 --> 35:55.840
Move in!

530
36:00.079 --> 36:00.360
Drop it!

531
36:00.360 --> 36:01.320
Don't move! Don't move!

532
36:02.159 --> 36:02.719
Don't move!

533
36:10.719 --> 36:11.960
Uncle Guang, the front is secured.

534
36:12.000 --> 36:12.679
How's the back?

535
36:12.920 --> 36:14.039
Poison Wolf hasn't shown up yet.

536
36:26.519 --> 36:27.880
Police! Come out and surrender!

537
36:34.239 --> 36:34.840
Get in the car!

538
37:03.559 --> 37:04.440
Suspect spotted at the back door.

539
37:04.760 --> 37:05.960
Suspect is driving toward Xiaguang Road.

540
37:06.119 --> 37:06.840
Requesting backup.

541
37:06.880 --> 37:07.440
Get in the car.

542
37:22.440 --> 37:23.039
What are you doing?

543
37:23.480 --> 37:24.039
Everyone, get out!

544
37:24.760 --> 37:25.679
The cops are right behind us!

545
37:25.800 --> 37:26.320
Are you crazy?

546
37:27.360 --> 37:28.679
The cops are locked onto us right now.

547
37:28.960 --> 37:30.000
We're actually safer on foot.

548
37:30.119 --> 37:31.000
Trust me.

549
37:32.840 --> 37:33.360
Move!

550
38:00.079 --> 38:00.559
Hurry, let's go!

551
38:08.400 --> 38:10.519
Police! Don't move!

552
38:11.679 --> 38:12.239
Don't move!

553
38:18.960 --> 38:19.360
Take them away!

554
38:19.719 --> 38:20.159
Move!

555
38:20.519 --> 38:21.199
Move, move, move!

556
38:21.320 --> 38:22.000
Keep moving! Hurry!

557
38:23.039 --> 38:23.519
Hurry!

558
38:37.840 --> 38:39.079
So you're Wei Kai.

559
38:42.360 --> 38:43.400
Former cop.

560
38:43.880 --> 38:44.840
Ex-special forces.

561
38:47.440 --> 38:49.000
You did right not killing him.

562
38:51.159 --> 38:52.280
Stick with me from now on.

563
38:52.480 --> 38:54.119
I take good care of my own men.

564
39:02.760 --> 39:04.800
If it weren't for you today,

565
39:04.840 --> 39:06.920
I wouldn't have lost so many men.

566
39:07.679 --> 39:08.920
I didn't want this either, Boss.

567
39:09.079 --> 39:11.320
You guys came looking for me.

568
39:11.320 --> 39:12.440
I wasn't looking for trouble.

569
39:13.119 --> 39:14.960
When will Cheng Weimin contact you?

570
39:16.000 --> 39:17.119
He said in a day or two.

571
39:17.400 --> 39:18.039
Exactly when?

572
39:18.159 --> 39:18.960
I honestly don't know.

573
39:20.199 --> 39:22.239
The cops are already onto you.

574
39:23.440 --> 39:25.679
With me, you can stay alive a bit longer.

575
39:31.199 --> 39:32.760
We were already exposed tonight.

576
39:33.320 --> 39:34.960
Maybe we should just run.

577
39:36.039 --> 39:36.840
Are you scared?

578
39:39.559 --> 39:41.679
Cheng Weimin broke the boss's rules.

579
39:42.079 --> 39:43.519
We can't just let him off the hook.

580
39:43.800 --> 39:45.000
Besides, he still has

581
39:45.039 --> 39:46.559
a lot of our client files.

582
39:48.559 --> 39:49.920
What do we do next then?

583
39:52.239 --> 39:54.920
First, use this kid to find Cheng Weimin.

584
39:59.719 --> 40:01.239
Then we head back to Country M.

585
40:06.239 --> 40:07.559
How does Cheng Weimin contact you?

586
40:08.760 --> 40:09.559
He calls me.

587
40:09.679 --> 40:10.440
Where's the phone?

588
40:12.199 --> 40:13.320
In my pants pocket.

589
40:24.079 --> 40:24.800
His cover's blown.

590
40:31.679 --> 40:32.440
Starting now,

591
40:32.679 --> 40:34.599
turn this phone on only once an hour,

592
40:34.599 --> 40:35.960
and for no more than a minute at a time.

593
40:36.039 --> 40:37.679
If someone calls and can't reach him,

594
40:37.880 --> 40:39.039
they'll probably send a text.

595
40:40.639 --> 40:42.000
It's fine. It doesn't matter if it's off.

596
40:42.480 --> 40:44.519
It shows missed calls once turned on.

597
40:55.360 --> 40:57.519
Once you go ashore, go straight to Uncle Gen.

598
40:57.719 --> 40:59.000
He'll arrange everything for you.

599
40:59.280 --> 41:01.599
You'll take a bus disguised as tourists

600
41:01.880 --> 41:03.679
and head to Jiangyang.

601
41:05.119 --> 41:06.320
While I'm away,

602
41:07.159 --> 41:08.400
take good care of Siqi for me.

603
41:10.599 --> 41:11.760
Don't worry, Old Ma.

604
41:13.159 --> 41:14.840
Boss Ma, Zhuang,

605
41:15.320 --> 41:17.719
take care on the road.

606
41:18.559 --> 41:19.159
Thanks.

607
41:20.639 --> 41:22.679
Didn't you say you wanted to visit mainland China?

608
41:23.000 --> 41:23.880
Come on, let's go together!

609
41:25.119 --> 41:26.679
Me? Forget it.

610
41:26.840 --> 41:27.960
As someone from Country M,

611
41:28.079 --> 41:30.519
I'd draw too much attention there.

612
41:30.800 --> 41:31.480
Come on!

613
41:31.840 --> 41:33.679
It's just business. What are you afraid of?

614
41:34.119 --> 41:35.000
If you're scared,

615
41:35.159 --> 41:36.039
you shouldn't be in this game.

616
41:37.000 --> 41:38.320
Me, scared?

617
41:40.400 --> 41:41.199
I'm just afraid...

618
41:41.480 --> 41:42.840
will you and Boss Ma

619
41:42.960 --> 41:45.199
even make it out of that hellhole alive?

620
41:45.880 --> 41:47.000
Right, Boss Ma?

621
42:11.360 --> 42:12.079
I've made up my mind.

622
42:12.440 --> 42:13.599
I'm going with you.

623
42:16.280 --> 42:17.039
We're going on business.

624
42:17.119 --> 42:18.039
Why do you want to tag along?

625
42:19.159 --> 42:20.320
I don't want to be left alone anymore,

626
42:20.320 --> 42:22.079
waiting anxiously for news from you.

627
42:23.400 --> 42:25.760
If you're going, I'm coming with you.

628
42:26.840 --> 42:28.480
Please don't leave me behind again.

629
42:29.480 --> 42:30.639
We're doing business.

630
42:30.800 --> 42:31.760
Having you around

631
42:33.719 --> 42:34.400
is trouble.

632
42:35.280 --> 42:36.280
Leaving me behind alone...

633
42:36.320 --> 42:37.400
isn't that trouble too?

634
42:38.159 --> 42:39.920
Do you trust that guy Jiang that much?

635
42:42.480 --> 42:43.199
What are you talking about?

636
42:44.000 --> 42:45.800
When Xiaobai came to ask me to save you,

637
42:46.280 --> 42:47.679
Mr. Jiang tested her.

638
42:51.400 --> 42:52.280
Did he give you a hard time?

639
42:54.800 --> 42:56.440
Mr. Jiang didn't trust her at the time,

640
42:56.599 --> 42:57.239
so...

641
42:58.679 --> 43:00.000
Under those circumstances,

642
43:00.760 --> 43:02.960
it's truly hard for anyone to accept.

643
43:05.360 --> 43:06.320
Jiang Liye is a man

644
43:06.440 --> 43:07.880
who has always been cautious.

645
43:08.159 --> 43:10.440
He didn't know Miss Ge at first,

646
43:10.480 --> 43:13.199
so crossing the line a bit was inevitable.

647
43:14.440 --> 43:15.000
Besides,

648
43:15.079 --> 43:16.960
now that Miss Ge insists on going with you,

649
43:16.960 --> 43:18.679
I actually think it's a good thing.

650
43:18.679 --> 43:20.320
Having a woman by your side

651
43:20.639 --> 43:22.000
can always serve as good cover.

652
43:28.519 --> 43:29.079
All right.

653
43:34.199 --> 43:35.480
Okay, it's getting late.

654
